@startuml UC-03
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-03.md
title UC-03: Logout
footer Feature AUTH-03 | Business rules: BR-04
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer / Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "AuthController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "AuthService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Click Logout
MVC -> API : POST /api/auth/logout (Bearer token)
API -> SVC : LogoutAsync(currentUserId)
SVC -> DB : Clear RefreshToken + RefreshTokenExpiresAt\nSaveChangesAsync (BR-04)
SVC --> API : OK
API --> MVC : 204 No Content
MVC -> MVC : Delete auth cookie (discard tokens)
MVC --> U : Signed out, redirect to home page

@enduml
